              "type": "text",
              "text": "Consider the figure shown below. Suppose that ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "\\angle AOB=\\theta",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " is an acute angle and is measured in radians.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
