    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p40-q18-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Using this fact, prove that $$\\cos\\theta\\leq\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\theta}\\leq\\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta}.$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\cos\\theta\\leq\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{\\theta}\\leq\\dfrac{1}{\\cos\\theta}$.\n\nCompare the triangle and sector areas, then divide by positive quantities.",
          "worked": "Since $OA=OD=1$, $OB=\\cos\\theta$, $AB=\\sin\\theta$ and $DC=\\tan\\theta$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\operatorname{area}(\\triangle AOB)&=\\frac12\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\\\\\operatorname{area}(\\operatorname{sector}(AOD))&=\\frac12\\theta\\\\\\operatorname{area}(\\triangle COD)&=\\frac12\\tan\\theta.\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe given area comparison gives\n$$\\frac12\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\leq\\frac12\\theta\\leq\\frac12\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}.$$\nDividing by $\\frac12\\sin\\theta>0$ gives\n$$\\cos\\theta\\leq\\frac{\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}\\leq\\frac1{\\cos\\theta}.$$\nTaking reciprocals reverses the inequalities, so\n$$\\cos\\theta\\leq\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{\\theta}\\leq\\frac1{\\cos\\theta}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 70
      },
      {
        "id": "p40-q18-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Hence, explain why $\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{\\theta}$ approaches $1$ as $\\theta$ approaches $0$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{\\theta}\\to1$.\n\nIt is squeezed between $\\cos\\theta$ and $\\frac{1}{\\cos\\theta}$, which both approach $1$.",
          "worked": "As $\\theta$ approaches $0$, both $\\cos\\theta$ and $\\dfrac1{\\cos\\theta}$ approach $1$. By part (a), $\\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{\\theta}$ lies between these quantities, so it also approaches $1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      }
    ]
